Vnum            10412
Name            渦核封檻臺~
Description
封檻臺懸在可見最深處，腳下渦潮沿巨大脈縫盤旋而下，像在引向更深不可測的裂核渦核。
~
SectorType      SECT_INSIDE

#Exit
Direction       UP
ExitVnum        10411
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       DOWN
ExitVnum        10501
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Enquire
Keyword         渦核~
End

#Enquire
Keyword         脈縫~
End

End
